|paprika]]\n*4 [[Cookbook:Bay Leaf|bay leaves]], torn\n*3 tbsp [[Cookbook:Celery Seed|celery seed]]\n*3 tbsp dehydrated [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]] peel\n*1 tbsp dehydrated [[Cookbook:Lime|lime]] peel\n*2 tbsp dried [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]]\n*3 tbsp dried [[Cookbook:Thyme|thyme]]\n*3 tbsp dried [[Cookbook:Oregano|oregano]]\n*¼ cup smoked [[Cookbook:Paprika|paprika]]\n*1 tbsp freshly ground [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Pulse everything in a spice grinder until relatively smooth. If your spice grinder doubles as your coffee grinder, make sure you pulse some rice after. \n#Keep in an airtight container with a shaker lid for up to 1 year.\n\n[[Category:Recipes for spice mixes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using celery seed]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lime zest]]\n[[Category:Recipes using paprika]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rosemary]]\n[[Category:Recipes using thyme]]\n[[Category:Recipes using oregano]]\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon zest]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Seafood Seasoning","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"6 tbsp butter-flavored salt","sourceText":"6 tbsp butter-flavored salt","amountText":"6 tbsp butter-flavored salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ cup sweet paprika","sourceText":"½ cup sweet paprika","amountText":"½ cup sweet paprika","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"4 bay leaves, torn","sourceText":"4 bay leaves, torn","amountText":"4 bay leaves, torn","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"3 tbsp celery seed","sourceText":"3 tbsp celery seed","amountText":"3 tbsp celery seed","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"3 tbsp dehydrated lemon peel","sourceText":"3 tbsp dehydrated lemon peel","amountText":"3 tbsp dehydrated lemon peel","amount":null,"unit":null,"f